@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0146>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0146" ;
  skos:prefLabel "as-of state"@eng ;
  skos:definition "state of a subject reconstructed from its event-sourced record at a specified past time, anchored by a notarized snapshot so that queries can answer what was legally true at that time"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The two authoritative query modes are the live view (freshness-labelled) and the notarized as-of snapshot (log-anchored); legal purpose selects the mode."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Transformation events hash-link their inputs by as-of state hash (concept dpp-0129), and profile-version bindings recorded as lifecycle events make manifest history as-of-reconstructable, answering questions such as whether a product was compliant when sold."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Mirrors and caches are always as-of stamped; the projection (concept dpp-0126) is computed from the record, so as-of queries are reproducible."@eng
 .